  "question": {
    "text": "The figure shows an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>RC</mi></math> circuit with a parallel plate capacitor. Before switching on the circuit, plate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> of the capacitor has a charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> while plate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> has no net charge. If at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the switch is closed then after how much time (in seconds) will the net charge on plate A becomes zero?[Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>μF</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mC</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image10-3f515633-0abf-407a-b2fa-0c105e9724e3.jpg\" style=\"height: 154px; width: 200px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let at any time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;the&nbsp;charge that flows from the plate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;to plate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> and the instantaneous current is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/abs/35250262-66a9-499c-9408-399f75ab0a43-image11-0d03ba1b-64dc-4ef2-815d-7e4267ff460a234.jpg\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 145px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>R</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ε</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ε</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now for the charge on plate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;to be zero <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ε</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ε</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ε</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
